From: surfacexue <surfacexue@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:25:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] config: offer ccache without DEVEL

The ccache prompt is hidden unless DEVEL is enabled, so a diffconfig that
sets CONFIG_CCACHE=y loses it again in "make defconfig". Show the prompt
always: ccache changes no image content, only how the build gets there.

CONFIG_AUTOREBUILD (default y, prompt also gated by DEVEL) must not be
switched on just to reach ccache.
---
 config/Config-devel.in | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/config/Config-devel.in b/config/Config-devel.in
--- a/config/Config-devel.in
+++ b/config/Config-devel.in
@@ -133,7 +133,7 @@ menuconfig DEVEL
 		  root filesystem directory.
 
 	config CCACHE
-		bool "Use ccache" if DEVEL
+		bool "Use ccache"
 		help
 		  Compiler cache; see https://ccache.samba.org/
 
